WEBVTT

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:03.780
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:06.150
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:10.090
Oh dear! Poor Nana-chan's come down with a fever!

00:00:10.090 --> 00:00:12.940
At times like this, we should visit her and bring flowers.

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:15.270
And cheer her on until her fever goes down!

00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:17.690
And feed her oodles of nutritious oatmeal!

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:20.830
Whatever, sheesh, just help me out already...

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:22.780
Just leave... everything to us!

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:23.960
Doki!

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:50.360
I'm gonna tell you a secret.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:53.270
Don't tell <i>anyone</i>, okay?

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.160
Even though I'm not girly at all,

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.930
two certain boys said they like me!

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:01.870
Jump up a bit into the sky.

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:04.750
My dearest friends are always there.

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:07.580
Even if you suddenly Character Change,

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:10.490
I'll be there to stop you with my great big heart.

00:01:10.490 --> 00:01:13.360
Pinky swear!

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:15.760
Cross my heart!

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:18.970
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:22.020
That'd be universal peace, but...

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:24.770
I'll end up protectin' everyone's hearts.

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:27.540
Let's all smile together!

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:30.400
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:33.210
That's world peace! Yeah, that!

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:36.440
Everyone has dreams, so I'm gonna protect 'em!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.260
Make a victory sign together!

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:04.030
Dee-lish! This banana youkan is darn tasty!

00:02:04.030 --> 00:02:06.830
Wouldn't you prefer uiro?

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:09.860
Now that I've tried it, it's a lot better than I thought.

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:10.910
I see.

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:14.300
You sure are makin' a ton of 'em.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:17.700
Wherever those lost people are, I'll be ready for them.

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:21.860
Weren't you just talking about how you should choose your targets wisely?

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:24.650
The target I "chose wisely" was useless,

00:02:24.650 --> 00:02:28.090
so I should hurry on to the next one without delay.

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:29.870
It'll be fine so long as I'm prepared.

00:02:34.030 --> 00:02:39.090
Episode 87
Save Nana! Guardian Character Nurses, Move Out?

00:02:40.670 --> 00:02:46.170
We haven't seen any movement in Easter's plan using Tsukiyomi Ikuto.

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:50.750
However, conversely, the incidents with the ? Eggs are continuing.

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:55.210
We've managed to deal with them so far, but...

00:02:55.210 --> 00:02:59.510
Maybe we should take a different approach from now on.

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:03.910
But you know... What are those ? Eggs in the first place?

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:08.320
One of Easter's plans to lure out the Embryo, I presume.

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:10.430
Anything beyond that is still a mystery.

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:15.030
No matter what they are, I can't forgive them for using people's dreams like that.

00:03:15.030 --> 00:03:19.920
Exactly, Amu-chan. In any case, we must all be especially vigilant.

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:27.820
Well then, let's head out on patrol!

00:03:27.820 --> 00:03:29.610
Where did that come from?

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:33.750
These banana youkan bean jelly sweets are all the rage lately!

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:35.620
We should all check them out!

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:36.900
Ah, that's why.

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:38.410
So you want to stop by there?

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:43.320
Well yeah, why not? They're supposed to be super yummy! Come on, let's go!

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:48.370
I suppose you could say it's part of a Guardian's duty to become attuned to the tastes of the townspeople...

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:49.900
Could be.

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:56.710
Sold out?

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:02.660
Darn tasty indeedy!

00:04:05.770 --> 00:04:08.840
So, does anyone know the answer to this question?

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:12.370
Yes, Mayuzumi Kahoru-san?

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:14.930
The Tokyo-tokkyo-kyoka-kyoku!

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:14.930
(Tokyo Special Patent Approval Department)

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:18.650
That's not it?

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:22.930
Sorry, but there's no such thing as the Tokyo Special Patent Approval Department!

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:25.640
Oh, really? Did you know that?

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:26.450
No.

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:27.200
Aw, I didn't know...

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:34.790
Hello? Yes.

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:37.630
I read the script.

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:43.550
It was absolutely wonderful, as always, Director Le Blanc.

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:45.640
Mont Blanc?

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:47.070
Le Branc!

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:49.580
The famous French film director.

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:52.500
So that means your mom's finally gonna...

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.830
Okay then, we'll discuss the details later.

00:04:57.200 --> 00:05:01.750
Maman, that's amazing! Being in a movie directed by Le Branc!

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:06.210
Yeah, it is... I'm going to do some shopping.

00:05:06.210 --> 00:05:07.360
Sure!

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:11.920
The time has finally come!

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:15.330
Guess we don't need that Embryo anymore then, huh?

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:18.170
No, we can't rest easy yet.

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:21.210
We must ensure that her new movie is a complete success,

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:25.840
so that everyone can see how wonderful she truly is!

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:28.090
And for that, we'll need the Embryo!

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:29.380
Gotcha.

00:05:29.380 --> 00:05:31.610
We'll get that Embryo, you betcha!

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:32.560
Nana!

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:35.970
I'll always be your partner, Lulu!

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:44.280
So today, we'll catch that Embryo!

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:47.320
All right, sense any lost souls out there, Nana?

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:52.870
Can't really feel anything.

00:05:53.840 --> 00:05:56.120
Surely someone out there has worries.

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:57.900
Ikuto...

00:05:57.900 --> 00:05:59.800
Where are you-nya?

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:01.860
I know you...

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:09.630
Yoru! You look like somethin' the cat dragged in.

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:11.590
Smile, darn it!

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:13.670
Stop it-nya!

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.900
So anyway, do you know where Ikuto is?

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:17.190
What're you doing-nya?

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:19.060
You're cuter this way!

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:21.870
Hey now, what are you two playing around for?

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:24.650
I'm not playing around! I'm searching for Ikuto!

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:25.730
Smile!

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:27.470
Cut it out-nya!

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:32.160
Man, forget I asked-nya!

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:34.630
Any lost people around here?

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:38.070
Which one should we see?

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:39.370
Dunno...

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:42.380
Should I choose action or romance?

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:45.520
Which one would be better for an awesome first date?

00:06:45.520 --> 00:06:49.880
It's not a big thing to be lost about, but I can sense his strong will...

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.980
Nana, Character Change.

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:53.530
Huh?

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:57.020
Nana!

00:06:57.320 --> 00:06:59.790
What's with you today?

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:03.920
'Tain't nothin', I'm just peachy...

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:05.270
Nana!

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:06.310
Nana!

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:10.280
You're burning up!

00:07:13.090 --> 00:07:16.700
If she has a fever, could she have the flu?

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:23.810
Adults: three pills. Children: two pills. Guardian Characters...

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:26.600
Yeah, like that'd actually be listed...

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:30.130
Medical Encyclopedia

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:32.220
And there's no way it'd be in here...

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:34.260
The only people who understand Guardian Characters are...

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:42.000
I can't ask those jerks at Easter!

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:56.770
You're doing great, Su!

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:00.790
Lulu?

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:03.780
Hello?

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:08.660
Lulu?

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:13.720
Um, well...

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:14.980
What's the matter?

00:08:16.570 --> 00:08:19.030
I have something to ask you.

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:22.600
I can't believe I'm actually going to Hinamori Amu for help!

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:31.690
Nana has a fever...

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:33.440
She does?

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:37.680
I don't know what to do.

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:41.120
So, I was wondering, have your Guardian Characters ever gotten sick?

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:43.430
My Guardian Characters?

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.590
Nope.

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:52.520
Sorry, I don't know what to tell you.

00:08:53.110 --> 00:08:54.190
Fine, forget it!

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:57.150
Wait! I'll ask the other Guardians.

00:08:57.790 --> 00:08:58.510
Huh?

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:00.510
What's up?

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:02.830
Nana's come down with something.

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:05.090
What? Nana's sick?

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:07.020
Lulu said she has a fever.

00:09:07.340 --> 00:09:09.030
Nana is sick?

00:09:09.030 --> 00:09:10.930
I'm worried.

00:09:14.090 --> 00:09:15.990
She's completely useless!

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:23.230
Hi.

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:24.290
Shugo, shugo!

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:27.160
Why are you guys here?

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:29.860
We came to wish Nana-chan well!

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:32.560
They insisted on coming.

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:34.610
I'm just escorting them.

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:37.550
And, I figured there might be something I could do to help.

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:41.020
Oh, if it isn't Amu-chan. You've been coming over a lot lately.

00:09:41.020 --> 00:09:43.330
Come in, come in!

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:45.070
Hello!

00:09:45.070 --> 00:09:46.830
Please, make yourself at home.

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:48.110
Thanks!

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:57.380
She's in rough shape...

00:09:58.880 --> 00:10:00.190
This looks like a job...

00:10:00.190 --> 00:10:01.550
...for the three of us!

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:02.580
Desu!

00:10:04.470 --> 00:10:06.290
When it comes to Guardian Characters...

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:08.170
Guardian Characters know best!

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:11.490
We'll take good care of Nana-chan!

00:10:11.490 --> 00:10:14.950
Just leave everything to the Guardian Character Nurses!

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:18.470
But you've never even been sick, have you?

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:21.680
Well, we'll figure it out somehow!

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:22.990
That's right!

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:25.040
Please trust us!

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:27.770
Is this gonna be okay?

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:28.980
Well, maybe...

00:10:43.070 --> 00:10:44.620
You guys?

00:10:44.920 --> 00:10:46.060
Doctor!

00:10:46.060 --> 00:10:48.150
38.5 degrees!

00:10:48.970 --> 00:10:51.150
Yup, it's probably the flu.

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:55.670
The best remedy is lots of rest and nourishment.

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:00.260
That's quite an interesting color.

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:03.480
Garlic, ginger, green onion, pickled plum...

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:06.820
There are plenty of healthy foods in there!

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:09.650
Give it a taste.

00:11:10.530 --> 00:11:13.720
I made it just like <i>your</i> Guardian Character instructed.

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:15.150
Take responsibility.

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:16.570
B-But...

00:11:16.870 --> 00:11:19.580
I'll try it if you do, Hinamori-san.

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:24.830
Nana, try this.

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:27.040
Here! Say, "ah!"

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:32.540
You can do it.

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:41.030
I've never been in so much pain...

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:43.970
This must be a serious illness...

00:11:44.270 --> 00:11:48.070
Is it my destiny to meet my end here?

00:11:48.070 --> 00:11:49.140
Nana!

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:51.240
That's not true!

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:52.790
I know you'll get better!

00:11:52.790 --> 00:11:54.780
We're here for you!

00:11:54.780 --> 00:11:56.520
You guys...

00:11:57.830 --> 00:11:58.900
Lulu?

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:00.420
Where are you going?

00:12:00.420 --> 00:12:02.770
I'm going out to buy Nana's favorite things.

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:04.820
That's all I can do right now.

00:12:05.590 --> 00:12:06.930
I'll come, too!

00:12:06.930 --> 00:12:09.720
Guys, take care of Nana for us, okay?

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:11.000
Roger!

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:13.070
Lulu, wait!

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:17.200
Nana!

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:20.180
My... My back itches...

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:26.070
I can't believe I can't even scratch my own back...

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:27.330
About here?

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:29.210
Have you gained weight?

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:34.600
Who cares? I ain't long for this world anyway!

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:37.150
Welcome!

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:39.610
I'll take one miso-katsu, and that's it!

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:42.320
Sorry, we only have normal katsu.

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:47.250
If they won't sell it, then we'll make it!

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:48.240
Lulu!

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:53.470
You seem rather stiff.

00:12:54.010 --> 00:12:56.500
How's that? Any better?

00:12:57.680 --> 00:13:00.410
If I only had a glass of cold water...

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:02.360
Here you go!

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:03.800
Thanks, guys!

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:05.620
Where would I find the miso?

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:07.150
Got it!

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:09.700
That's white miso!

00:13:09.700 --> 00:13:12.130
You need <i>hacchou</i> miso to make miso-katsu, dummy!

00:13:12.130 --> 00:13:13.900
S-Sorry...

00:13:16.710 --> 00:13:19.280
Her fever isn't going down...

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:23.150
There's no savin' me anymore...

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:36.800
When all of those flower petals fall, it'll mean the end for me!

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:38.700
T-That's not true!

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:40.380
Hurry, find more flowers!

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:43.710
Ran!

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:46.140
Over here, over here!

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:52.510
Unagi, tempura, and hacchou miso!

00:13:53.550 --> 00:13:56.210
But if we're making miso-katsu, I need to buy cabbage.

00:13:57.090 --> 00:13:58.650
Wait up!

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:03.940
With this many, you'll live forever!

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:05.990
Forever?

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:09.460
You mean, this pain will continue forever?

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:13.650
To be bedridden, trapped on this dusty old futon for all eternity...

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:17.130
I'd at least like to sleep on a nice, soft, down one.

00:14:17.130 --> 00:14:18.570
Down?

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:20.800
She means one made from bird feathers.

00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:25.380
I'll just take a few, okay?

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:28.140
You can do it, you can do it!

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:30.110
Finished!

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:36.330
It's all soft and fluffy and feels so darn nice...

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:44.050
Hey! Watch that pot!

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:55.060
Ah, I no longer have any regrets...

00:14:55.060 --> 00:14:57.250
Don't give in, Nana!

00:14:58.030 --> 00:14:58.790
Nana!

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:05.880
These are all famous Nagoya dishes! Eat them, you'll feel better!

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:09.630
I don't have much of an appetite right now...

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:13.200
Nana turned down Nagoyan food?

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:16.320
If she's turning away food, then...

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:21.440
Banana youkan?

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:25.140
Did you eat all of the ones you stocked up?

00:15:25.140 --> 00:15:27.790
Well, I ate one, and then another, and then...

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:30.060
I couldn't stop myself.

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:34.830
You got a fever from eating too many banana youkan?

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:37.350
I can see Nana doing that...

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:40.890
That's what caused this?

00:15:42.840 --> 00:15:45.210
Sorry about all the fuss.

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:54.540
Her fever seems to finally be going down.

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:57.720
Man, what a pain.

00:15:57.720 --> 00:16:00.650
But at least we know what happened!

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:06.940
Oh wow, these are pretty!

00:16:10.380 --> 00:16:11.270
Huh?

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:14.850
I have a feeling I've seen this before.

00:16:14.850 --> 00:16:16.490
Y-You're imagining things!

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:18.830
It's nothing particularly rare or special.

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:27.250
Lulu, you remind me of someone I know.

00:16:28.610 --> 00:16:30.460
Utau-chan, right?

00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:35.190
Utau? Oh, Tsukiyomi Ikuto's little sister.

00:16:35.190 --> 00:16:37.480
How exactly do I resemble her?

00:16:37.480 --> 00:16:39.560
You know Ikuto?

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:43.460
Um...

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:46.440
You see, Nana knows Yoru,

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:48.430
but I don't know him all that well.

00:16:48.430 --> 00:16:50.790
Oh, I see.

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:55.450
It's pretty late.

00:16:55.750 --> 00:16:57.720
I should head home soon.

00:16:57.720 --> 00:16:58.660
All right...

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:01.480
But will Nana be okay?

00:17:01.480 --> 00:17:04.000
She still has a bit of a fever...

00:17:05.990 --> 00:17:06.960
Maman?

00:17:07.280 --> 00:17:09.840
Amu-chan, would you join us for dinner?

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:11.800
But...

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:15.040
I have an idea! Why don't you eat dinner and then stay the night?

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:16.310
Maman!

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:19.390
Okay! Maybe I will!

00:17:20.170 --> 00:17:22.530
Is that all right with you, Lulu?

00:17:22.530 --> 00:17:24.890
I-I suppose... If you insist...

00:17:27.840 --> 00:17:32.280
Yes. We'll take good care of Amu-chan tonight, don't worry.

00:17:34.020 --> 00:17:38.330
This is the first time Lulu's ever had a friend stay over.

00:17:38.330 --> 00:17:41.610
I'm really glad it's a wonderful girl like you, Amu-chan.

00:17:41.610 --> 00:17:43.450
Aw, shucks...

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:47.700
Lulu really seems to enjoy spending time with you.

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:50.560
I haven't seen her like that for a while.

00:17:51.510 --> 00:17:53.830
Back when she was little...

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:58.140
She was interested in everything; she wanted to become everything.

00:17:58.140 --> 00:18:00.260
She had fun every day.

00:18:01.140 --> 00:18:04.730
I want Lulu to be more carefree,

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:06.140
just like she was back then.

00:18:15.340 --> 00:18:18.450
Delicious! Darn tasty!

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:21.980
Maman's meat and potato stew is the world's best!

00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:23.700
Oh, Papa!

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:27.530
I'm worried I'll eat so much my stomach will burst!

00:18:27.530 --> 00:18:29.830
Well then, Papa, you know what to do!

00:18:30.680 --> 00:18:33.760
Feelin' even more good!

00:18:33.760 --> 00:18:36.630
The newest model is more effective than ever before!

00:18:37.490 --> 00:18:39.750
I saw your new commercial!

00:18:39.750 --> 00:18:41.810
My little sister's always copying it.

00:18:41.810 --> 00:18:43.410
"Even more!"

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:45.940
Really? That's great!

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:50.350
I forgot the soy sauce! Sorry about that!

00:18:51.990 --> 00:18:54.870
Your mom is great, Lulu.

00:18:54.870 --> 00:19:00.030
I guess so. But she's at her best when she's being an actress.

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:03.400
I'm sure that her next film will be a wonderful work.

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:05.870
She's going to be in a movie?

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:07.380
I can't wait to see it!

00:19:09.780 --> 00:19:10.760
Yeah...

00:19:14.410 --> 00:19:17.180
No more banana youkan...

00:19:25.190 --> 00:19:26.490
Today...

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:27.500
Hey, Lulu...

00:19:28.440 --> 00:19:30.870
Guardian Characters are mysterious, don't you think?

00:19:32.670 --> 00:19:38.490
It feels natural to have them around now, but it was a bit unsettling at first.

00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:42.100
Guardian Characters are who you want to be,

00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:46.570
which means Ran and the others are my dreams.

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:48.830
Dreams?

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:52.120
I don't know anything about what'll happen in the future.

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:54.660
But when I think about it, I get really excited.

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:58.590
I wonder what I'll be doing when I grow up...

00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:04.140
Hey, Lulu, what do you want to do?

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:06.560
I...

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:12.160
Just do what y'all wanna do!

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:26.620
Mornin', y'all!

00:20:26.920 --> 00:20:29.200
How long are y'all gonna sleep?

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:30.420
Nana?

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:32.750
Good morning...

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:34.910
Looks like she's back from the dead.

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:37.190
Thanks a bunch for yesterday!

00:20:37.190 --> 00:20:40.440
I'll treat you to some shrimp tempura as thanks!

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:45.640
Nana... Sheesh, after all the trouble you caused...

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:47.970
Ah, yeah, sorry about that...

00:20:48.280 --> 00:20:51.350
Well, at least she's feeling better, right?

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:58.070
Um... Thanks for yesterday.

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:04.430
W-What?

00:21:04.430 --> 00:21:06.490
I was just thinking of how that's so like you.

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:11.180
Derya! Dorya! Shrimp tempura!

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:11.180
Hey, quiet down.

00:21:11.180 --> 00:21:14.560
For some reason, I'm full of energy!

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:20.300
All right! Today, we're gonna take some ? Eggs and find that Embryo!

00:21:20.600 --> 00:21:21.410
Huh?

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:36.930
What was that?

00:21:55.060 --> 00:21:56.390
That's right.

00:21:58.280 --> 00:22:03.880
I've been the one extracting ? Eggs, in order to obtain the Embryo.

00:22:04.450 --> 00:22:05.760
But...

00:22:31.840 --> 00:22:36.410
Maybe I was wrong to pretend not to notice your worries.

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:41.220
It's okay if you can't tell me everything.

00:22:41.220 --> 00:22:43.600
With that dark look on your face,

00:22:43.600 --> 00:22:45.840
go ahead and scream dark things.

00:22:45.840 --> 00:22:50.150
You shouldn't leave all those heavy feelings inside.

00:22:50.150 --> 00:22:51.630
Ride On!

00:22:55.020 --> 00:22:57.830
If you don't... If it's like that...

00:22:57.830 --> 00:23:00.750
You couldn't tell me if you wanted to, huh?

00:23:02.010 --> 00:23:04.500
I get it.

00:23:04.500 --> 00:23:07.160
I'm sure your circumstances will change one day.

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:10.190
That time will come! That time is now!

00:23:14.010 --> 00:23:15.820
Don't you want to have someone

00:23:15.820 --> 00:23:18.450
say congratulations to you once in your life?

00:23:18.450 --> 00:23:23.380
Doesn't the breeze feel nice today?

00:23:23.380 --> 00:23:27.750
Even if you feel like it's all you can do to survive...

00:23:27.750 --> 00:23:32.620
You can make your life into something you enjoy. It's so nice!

00:23:32.620 --> 00:23:37.440
"Everything's for you."

00:23:37.440 --> 00:23:42.040
How about that?

00:23:43.740 --> 00:23:45.190
My boy!

00:23:50.250 --> 00:23:55.300
Why did this have to happen? I thought we'd finally become friends...

00:23:55.300 --> 00:23:59.690
But Lulu's been taking the ? Eggs from people's hearts...

00:23:59.690 --> 00:24:00.790
Amu-chan...

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:02.540
I'm sure she has a good reason for it!

00:24:02.810 --> 00:24:06.340
Yeah! Lulu and Nana aren't bad people!

00:24:06.340 --> 00:24:08.870
That's right! Let's believe in them!

00:24:08.870 --> 00:24:10.520
Amu-chan!

00:24:10.520 --> 00:24:12.730
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.730 --> 00:24:15.050
Confrontation! The Great ? Egg Calamity!

00:24:15.350 --> 00:24:19.500
I believe in Lulu's heart! In my friend's heart!
